<rml>
<head>
    <title>Minefield</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="../menu.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-grid="green">
    <div id="panel">
        <div class="title">Minefield</div>
        <div class="subtitle">Find the hidden mines without setting one off</div>
        <div class="list" data-list="minefield_sizes"></div>
        <div class="item" id="sphere_small" data-action="command:minefield_sphere:0">On the Sphere: Small<span class="note">test: 12 × 12, 20 mines</span></div>
        <div class="item" id="sphere_medium" data-action="command:minefield_sphere:1">On the Sphere: Medium<span class="note">test: 20 × 20, 60 mines</span></div>
        <div class="item" id="sphere_full" data-action="command:minefield_sphere:2">On the Sphere: Full<span class="note">test: the whole sphere, 130 mines</span></div>
        <div class="item" id="back" data-action="back">Back</div>
        <div class="hint">Each number tells you how many of the eight cells around it hide a mine. Flag the mines; uncover everything else.</div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
